datagrid — a spreadsheet-grade data table demo

usage: datagrid [options] [PATH]

Arguments:
  PATH                 CSV file to load

Options:
  -s, --surface        draw through the raw surface painter, not gfx
      --screen=<name>  screen to open at start
                         (one of: home, settings, photos) [default: home]
  -r, --rows=<n>       how many rows to synthesize
                         [default: 200000]
  -o, --out=<PATH>     where to write the export
                         (required)
      --tag=<value>    extra tag, may repeat
  -h, --help           show this help

========

wifi — scan and watch wireless interfaces

usage: wifi [options] [command]

Commands:
  monitor        watch connect/disconnect events live
  scan           one-shot scan of visible networks

Options:
  -v, --verbose  print the raw control-socket replies
  -h, --help     show this help

========

monitor — watch connect/disconnect events live

usage: monitor [options] <IFACE>

Arguments:
  IFACE       interface to watch
                (required)

Options:
      --once  stop after the first event
  -h, --help  show this help

========

parsed=false help=true exit=0
usage: tiny [options]

Options:
      --loud  be loud
  -h, --help  show this help

========

parsed=false help=true
scan — one-shot scan of visible networks

usage: scan [options]

Options:
      --iface=<value>  interface to scan
                         [default: wlan0]
  -h, --help           show this help

========

mktool — build things

usage: mktool [options] <target>...

Arguments:
  TARGET                        targets to build

Options:
      --configuration-directory=<DIR>
                                where the configs live
  -h, --help                    show this help
